flowchart TD
    A[Escrow Payment Flow] --> B[Job Created]
    B --> C[Buyer Makes Payment]
    C --> D[Funds Held in Escrow]
    D --> E[Seller Performs Service]
    E --> F[Seller Marks Complete]
    F --> G[Buyer Confirms Satisfaction]
    G --> H[Funds Released to Seller]
    
    F --> I[Buyer Raises Dispute?]
    I -->|Yes| J[Escrow Frozen]
    J --> K[Admin Manual Resolution]
    K --> L[Partial/Full Release Decision]